# Asymmetry 7 — missing tool. There is no Archer in this fight at all.
# Two high ridges wall off a central trench. Nobody climbs for free, and Bull Rush
# cannot enter high ground, so the ledge is a wall you shove things into.
#   .  open        #  wall        O  pit        ^  spikes      H  high ground
#   A  Player A deploy slot       B  Player B deploy slot
#   any other letter = an enemy declared by a 'spawn' line below

id: as-07-the-terraces
number: 407
name: The Terraces
description: No Archer on either side, and two ridges nobody can climb cheaply. Two Lobbers plink from the trench between them.

spawn h = Husk
spawn l = Lobber
spawn n = Anchor

roster a: Threadcaster, Threadcaster
roster b: Vanguard, Wardbearer

